- Run focused tests:
  - `python3 -m pytest python/test_external_role_defaults.py -q`
  - `python3 -m pytest python/test_bootstrap.py python/test_checks.py python/test_plan_quality.py -q`
  - `python3 -m pytest python/test_plan_review_panel.py python/test_agent_voters.py python/test_review_pipeline.py -q`
  - `python3 -m pytest python/test_decompose.py python/test_plan_scout.py python/test_design_lifecycle.py -q`
  - `python3 -m pytest python/test_rebase.py python/test_ci_monitor.py python/test_agents.py python/test_config.py -q`
- Run affected harness:
  - `make test-implement-step2-routing`
  - `make test-dispatch-plan-voters`
  - `make test-dispatch-code-voters-happy`
  - `make test-review-and-fix`
  - `make test-scout-dynamic-archetypes`
  - `make test-scout-plan-archetypes-wrapper`
- Final required checks:
  - `make lint`
  - `make py-lint`
  - `make py-test`

